WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.328
The indie search

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.590
engine is quietly

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.215
getting better

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.153
Marginalia Search is

00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:06.096
an independent search

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:06.568
engine

00:00:06.651 --> 00:00:07.665
and its latest

00:00:07.476 --> 00:00:08.738
update is mostly

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.740
bug fixes and

00:00:09.646 --> 00:00:10.966
technical debt cleanup

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:12.193
not new features

00:00:12.718 --> 00:00:13.696
The author says

00:00:13.508 --> 00:00:14.557
most big parts

00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:15.076
of the engine

00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:15.689
are in place

00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:16.373
so the work

00:00:16.185 --> 00:00:17.187
now is smaller

00:00:17.235 --> 00:00:18.508
more deliberate steps

00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:19.192
toward the goal

00:00:19.718 --> 00:00:20.661
Funding is going

00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:21.121
up too

00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:22.748
SerpApi sponsored the

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.762
project with ten

00:00:23.574 --> 00:00:24.906
thousand dollars and

00:00:24.718 --> 00:00:25.508
donations

00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:26.746
and API key

00:00:26.558 --> 00:00:27.925
sales keep rising

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:29.460
Full story on

00:00:29.271 --> 00:00:30.167
the dashboard
